OL,3,GNEWSAJimmy McGovern claims young
OL,4,Aoffender institution staff 'lazy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBafta-winning screenwriter Jimmy
OL,7,FMcGovern has said going into young
OL,8,Foffender institutions to research his
OL,9,Fnew drama left him believing that
OL,10,Fkeeping inmates isolated from each
OL,11,Fother for long periods allowed staff to
OL,12,F"sit on their backsides all day and do
OL,13,Fnothing".
OL,15,FMcGovern said he was shocked after
OL,16,Fvisiting "appalling" facilities while
OL,17,Fresearching the latest series of his
OL,18,FBBC drama Time.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
